# from .gitignore
modules/yt_tmp.wav
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/outputs/
**/models/

**/.idea
**/.git
**/.github

# Negations (whitelist) — these patterns re-include paths that the rules above
# would otherwise exclude. They are REQUIRED for the segment-merger speaker
# awareness fix (commit da2e2e2) to be baked into the production image:
#   - modules/whisper/data_classes.py  (Segment.speaker field)
#   - modules/whisper/segment_merger.py (SPEAKER_PREFIX_RE + speaker-aware merge)
#   - modules/diarize/diarizer.py      (pydantic-v2 "speaker" in segment fix)
# Without these, the Dockerfile's `COPY . .` would silently skip the fix and
# the baked image would be functionally identical to the pre-fix upstream image.
# See FORK_MAINTENANCE.md "Local Image Rebuild" section for rationale.
!modules/
!modules/**
